        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n)}{\\pi n}} & {= \\frac {1}{2} \\cdot \\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n)}{\\frac {\\pi}{2} n}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{2} \\operatorname{Sal} (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n)} \\end{array}\n$$",
