            218,
            450,
            236
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)}{\\pi n} = \\frac {1}{8} \\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)}{\\frac {\\pi}{8} n} = \\frac {1}{8} \\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
