    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {(1) H _ {1} (z)} & {= \\frac {1}{a - \\frac {1}{2} z} = \\frac {- 2}{z - 2 a}} \\\\ & {= \\sqrt {\\frac {- 2 z}{z - 2 a}} \\cdot z ^ {- 1}} \\\\ & {= 2 (2 a) ^ {n} u (n)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
