            424
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {h _ {2} (n)} & {= 4 (4) ^ {n - 1} u (- n)} \\\\ & {= 4 ^ {n} u (- n)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            705,
            375,
            879,
            447
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "易错点",
        "bbox": [
            893,
            384,
            960,
            416
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 求系统函数 $H(z)$ , 并画出零极点图;",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            431,
            521,
            450
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "∵|2|＜4梯\n↓足",
        "bbox": [
            890,
            416,
            996,
            453
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 求该系统所表示的差分方程;",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            458,
            459,
            478
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $\\frac{y}{3}x(n)=\\sqrt{n}$ 时 $y(n)=h(n)$",
        "bbox": [
            480,
            460,
            754,
            493
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$H_{2}(e^{i\\omega})\\pi_{3}\\pi$",
        "bbox": [
            908,
            450,
            993,
            475
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4) 画出系统的直接型模拟框图。",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            486,
